  "query_preview": "..\nIssued 1200 PM CDT Mon Jul 20 2026\n\nWednesday through Monday:\n\nHigh pressure will push over souther WI and northern IL for\nWednesday and stick over the area through at least Thursday\nwhile gradually drifting east and gradually weakening through\nFriday. There is at least some potential for convection Friday\nand Saturday but this appears unlikely at this time given a bit\nmore activity aloft. However, chances increase late weekend and\nearly next week as lower pressure swings in. Uncertainty \nincreases for this period but looks to be the best chance for \nprecip and storms in the extended. Timing will determine any \nstorm concerns for this but too early to tell at this time. \n\nKuroski",
